  "@id": "https://github.com/Jacklugano/glass-box-prompting",
  "name": "Glass-Box Prompting",
  "alternateName": "GBP",
  "description": "A semantic anchoring protocol for professional documents. Each issuer publishes their adopted conventions transparently, so readers — human or AI — can consult them rather than infer.",
  "abstract": "Glass-Box Prompting (GBP) is an open protocol for declaring the semantic conventions adopted by an issuer in their professional documents. It enables human readers and AI assistants to consult verifiable authorial sources rather than infer the meaning of terms, codes, and standards used in the document. The protocol does not instruct AI on what to do. It documents what the issuer means.",
